# The build context is this producer's own directory, and only its control
# templates are COPYed out of it. The shared copyright file lives one level up
# and arrives through the `family` named context producer.env declares, so an
# edit to the driver, the README or a sibling producer cannot invalidate this
# producer's context.
#
# There is no `bin` or `dist` context here. This producer's whole payload is
# generated inside the packing stage from the two profile values.
*
!control/*.control
